sequenceDiagram
    participant View as AgenticAiView
    participant CM as ContextManager
    participant Idx as Indexer
    participant Emb as Embedder
    participant Store as VectorStore
    participant Coll as ChromaDB Collection

    View->>CM: indexCurrentProject()

    Note over Idx: Error type: File too large
    alt File exceeds maxFileSize during scan
        Idx->>Idx: emit('error', { phase: 'scan', recoverable: true })
        Note over Idx: File skipped, pipeline continues
    end

    Note over Idx: Error type: Embedding failure
    alt Single chunk embedding fails
        Idx->>Emb: embed(text)
        Emb--xIdx: Error (timeout, model issue)
        Idx->>Idx: Record in failedIndices
        Idx->>Idx: emit('error', { phase: 'embed', recoverable: true })
        Note over Idx: Chunk skipped (NOT zero-filled)<br/>Array alignment preserved via index tracking
        Idx->>Idx: Filter out failed embeddings before cache
        Note over Idx: Pipeline continues with valid chunks
    end

    Note over Idx: Error type: Fatal model failure
    alt Model fails to load / all embeddings fail
        Idx--xCM: Promise rejects with Error
        CM--xView: Error propagated
        View->>View: Show error notification
        View->>View: Reset button state (INDEX PROJECT)
        View->>View: Progress label → ERROR
    end

    Note over View: View always cleans up in finally block
    View->>Idx: removeListener('progress')
    View->>Idx: removeListener('error')

    Note over Store: Error type: Batch insert failure
    alt Batch too large for ChromaDB
        Store->>Coll: collection.add(batch of 200)
        Coll--xStore: Error
        Store->>Store: Halve batchSize (200 → 100)
        Store->>Store: emit('error', { phase: 'ingest', recoverable: true })
        Store->>Coll: Retry with batch of 100
        alt Still fails
            Store->>Store: Halve again (100 → 50)
            Store->>Coll: Retry with batch of 50
            alt Below minimum (50)
                Store->>Store: emit('error', { recoverable: false })
                Note over Store: Skip batch, continue with next
            end
        else Success
            Coll-->>Store: Batch confirmed
        end
    end

    Note over Store: Error type: ChromaDB connection failure
    alt VectorStore.connect() fails
        Store->>Store: ChromaClient constructor or getCollection fails
        Store--xCM: Promise rejects with Error
        CM--xView: Error propagated
        View->>View: atom.notifications.addError('Failed to update database')
    end

    Note over View: Error type: LLM unreachable
    alt OllamaClient.sendPrompt() fails
        View->>View: Check error.message for diagnostics
        alt ECONNREFUSED / not running
            View->>View: addError('Ollama not reachable')<br/>hint: ollama serve
        else Model issue
            View->>View: addError('Model issue')<br/>hint: ollama pull <model>
        else Other
            View->>View: addError('Generation failed')
        end
    end
